  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a9f4185281afaf46926db1a25a2822d, type: 3}
  m_Name: juyan-arrival-3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 
  isBlocking: 1
  id: 1003
  dialogList:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: 
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: General, observe. The waystation yonder may be abandoned, but its
      foundations remain deeply rooted in the earth. As long as the banner of Han
      flies here, profit-driven merchants will gather like a herd of horses scenting
      fresh grass.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: 
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: Furthermore, the military camps can enlist able-bodied men in their
      prime, arming them with heavy crossbows and long halberds. Force is the sole
      leverage we possess in any negotiation with the Xiongnu.
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 040104332c0706043997fff01846f372, type: 2}
    overrideName: 
    overridePortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a72dbe276cf1e34bb4a7bd81cd2e9b9, type: 3}
    useBlackboardName: 0
    nameKey: 
    dialogText: General Zheng, the internal settlements are now complete. Juyan stands
      as a solid springboard for our westward advance. Once you have marshaled your
      forces, you may turn your sword toward the Western Regions and reclaim our
      lost territories. The exact timing of the EXPEDITION is left entirely to your
      discretion.
